---
layout: base.njk
title: Documentation & Guidelines
permalink: /docs/
---
<div class="docs-index" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
  <header style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <p
      style="font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #ff9800; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">
      Internal Portal
    </p>
    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0;">Documentation & Guidelines</h1>
    <p style="color: #bbb; line-height: 1.6;">
      Welcome to the internal portal for writers, proofreaders, and maintainers. Here you'll find the contribution
      workflow, editorial standards, and codebase documentation.
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="docs-list" style="display: grid; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">
    {% for item in collections.docs %}
    {% if item.url != "/docs/" %}
    <a href="{{ item.url }}"
      style="display: block; padding: 1.25rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: border-color 0.2s;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; font-size: 1.25rem; color: #ffb74d;">{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
      {% if item.data.description %}
      <p style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #ccc;">{{ item.data.description }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if item.data.category %}
      <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #888;">
        Category: {{ item.data.category }}
      </span>
      {% endif %}
    </a>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
